# With Google services on, restores Chrome Web Store installs, which
# disable-webstore-urls.patch and 0005-disable-default-extensions.patch remove:
# the store is recognised by its real origin, gets webstorePrivate and its own
# process, and WebstoreInstaller downloads and installs CRX files again.

